   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s008",
   "start": 23.32,
   "end": 29.18,
   "line": "So what if you could fly? Not in a plane. Just you. First, the bad news.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s009",
   "start": 29.18,
   "end": 32.98,
   "line": "You're built for walking, not flying. If you wanted to flap like a bird,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s010",
   "start": 32.98,
   "end": 36.52,
   "line": "scientists estimate you'd need wings about six metres across.",
